---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';

const sections = [
  {
    title: 'Install',
    href: '/docs/install',
    body: 'The one-line install prompt, what it actually does, and the five-question setup flow.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Phase 2 · Context seeding',
    href: '/docs/phase-2',
    body: 'How the agent imports existing vaults, pulls from your connected tools, and drafts your core context files.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Phase 3 · Automations',
    href: '/docs/phase-3-automations',
    body: 'Scheduled triggers — daily reindex, weekly review, quarterly archive, optional morning brief.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Continuous capture',
    href: '/docs/continuous-capture',
    body: 'Three-layer passive capture: session stubs every 2h, opt-in external ingestion from Granola/Slack/Gmail, and an append-only audit ledger with undo.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Update protocol',
    href: '/docs/update-protocol',
    body: 'How /thinkos-update fetches latest, detects drift on managed files, and re-applies without touching your vault.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Multi-vault architecture',
    href: '/docs/multi-vault',
    body: 'Personal hub, project vaults, reference vaults. Privacy boundary enforced by schema.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Uninstall',
    href: '/docs/uninstall',
    body: 'How to remove Think OS cleanly. Vault data is preserved by default.',
  },
];
---
<DocsLayout
  title="Docs"
  description="Reference for installing, configuring, and using Think OS."
  current="overview"
>
  <p>
    Think OS is documented as it's built. The canonical reference for any
    behavior lives in the repo's <code>docs/</code> and <code>adapters/claude-code/INSTALL.md</code>.
    These pages are entry points; each links out to the source file on GitHub
    while we get the in-site rendering wired up.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-12 mb-6 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight">Sections</h2>

  <div class="not-prose space-y-px bg-rule border border-rule">
    {sections.map((s) => (
      <a href={s.href} class="block bg-paper p-5 md:p-6 hover:bg-soft transition-colors group">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-tight group-hover:text-accent transition-colors">{s.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-muted max-w-[60ch]">{s.body}</p>
          </div>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted shrink-0 self-center">Read →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-16 mb-6 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight">Source</h2>
  <p>
    The full repository:
    <a href="https://github.com/dhirajsapkal/think-os">github.com/dhirajsapkal/think-os</a>.
    Open issues for anything confusing, broken, or missing.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
